# Git and VCS
**/.git
**/.github
**/.gitignore

# Build outputs
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/publish/

# IDE and Editor files
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/*.user
**/*.*proj.user

# Local configuration, development secrets, and environment variables
**/.env*
**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/values.dev.yaml
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/SETUP-CLIENT*.md

# Dependencies and caches
**/node_modules/
**/packages/
**/*.tmp
**/*.log
